{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：識與諸法為先義也。故《起信論》\n云「一切時常在前故」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：識為諸法作增上緣故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：無始戲論薰習種子，為識初起之因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：此明一切法種為識所生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：依諸種子及上心發識，\n現在為異熟，故用此異熟為體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識與諸法一，諸法復與本識\n一，如醍醐同器也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：識持諸色根，令根明了也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：識為諸根所依成依因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明識與戲論熏習上心種子\n為所依處也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識\n相續生起離諸分別，不可分別知也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識與器世界同，世界與本識一，而得成就名了別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識相無分別故，順不苦不樂受，名相應也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識俗諦離諸分別故，不覆沒聖道，亦無事中善惡記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識與轉識等作因時，互為生因亦為依因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識與染淨法同時同處相應共生共滅種子，\n及上心流在現前，名俱轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：\n明彼本識心成染污法，於中有能，故為業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：明彼本識於還淨有能，令生死還淨，是其業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：論自釋言「此言顯有異熟識」，即引識義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：論自釋言「此言顯有一切種子識」，同前引證之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：此顯教興所為分齊，聲聞凡夫不為說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：法者可軌也。此\n通教主義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂出生立義宗法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：\n謂引證喻合法等方便也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂隨方言音教法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂施名於義法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂成教則也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂授\n與他人言說則也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂諸宗法門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂諸解行能\n入智也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂教義相應，廣釋決擇也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：謂究竟\n義宗成說安立也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦言三三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名三三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曇遷禪師撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十五字為一行，二十行為一紙葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從如是我聞已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從發問已去是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從入淨藏定已後是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從說五海已後是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從立世界已後是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當知此蓮華藏世界海下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼大斫迦羅山已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼大地處已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此香水海上已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云常寂光，從乃往久遠過世界已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十忍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從〈入法界品〉初已下，至爾時文殊說此偈已告善財\n言：善男子於此南方有一國土名曰可樂已前是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從有國土名可樂已後，\n至爾時善財得見三千大千世界微塵數知識已前是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在普賢長行後說偈前有此語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從爾時善財得見三千大千世界微塵已後，盡說如來功德不思議界上境界入品已前是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此方名多雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祝藥者說藥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "休捨者，梵音呼捨也。呼捨者，此云靜義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云解脫聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云慈優婆姨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云聲悅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云天支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云到淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云門至陰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云依止不畏，準梵本應云婆娑婆也多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
